{
  "schema": "cablesim.plugin/2",
  "id": "cablesim.gb50217-correction",
  "version": "1.0.8",
  "name": "GB 50217 载流量校正",
  "description": "按附录 D 对有出处的单根基准载流量校正；表外条件拒绝，系数由标准依据库核验。",
  "icon": "assets/icon.svg",
  "publisher": {
    "id": "cablesim",
    "name": "CableSimPro"
  },
  "host_api": {
    "major": 2,
    "min_minor": 1
  },
  "license": {
    "spdx": "LicenseRef-Project-Undeclared",
    "review_required": false
  },
  "platforms": [
    "windows-x64",
    "linux-x64",
    "darwin-arm64",
    "darwin-x64"
  ],
  "runtime": {
    "kind": "python",
    "python": ">=3.11,<3.14",
    "entry": "src/cablesim_gb50217_correction/main.py"
  },
  "permissions": [
    "study.run",
    "artifact.write"
  ],
  "dependencies": [],
  "resources": {
    "timeout_s": 60,
    "memory_mb": 512,
    "network": "none"
  },
  "capabilities": [
    {
      "kind": "method",
      "id": "steady-rating",
      "title": "按 GB 50217 校正",
      "solver": "local",
      "method_version": "1.1.0",
      "analysis": "ampacity_correction",
      "input_schema": "cablesim.domain/1",
      "outputs": [
        {
          "key": "ampacity",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "circuit",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.gb50217.baseline-current",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "circuit",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "key": "x-cablesim.gb50217.correction-factor",
          "type": "quantity",
          "per": "circuit",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "artifacts": [
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.gb50217-correction",
          "required": true
        },
        {
          "type": "x-cablesim.headline-witness",
          "required": true
        }
      ],
      "validation": {
        "level": "analytic-benchmark",
        "cases": [
          "tests/test_gb50217_correction.py"
        ]
      },
      "limitations": [
        "仅 10 kV 及以下；相同型号、正常温限和中心埋深的单根基准。",
        "覆盖 D.0.1 温度表与 D.0.2 公式、D.0.3 土壤、D.0.4 / D.0.5 单层并列；D.0.6 仅覆盖明确保存并有来源的梯架或托盘、1–4 层、每层不少于 7 根水平接触的同型号三芯电缆，各层横向排列相同。",
        "D.0.3 仅用于表 C.0.1-2；并列表不用于三相交流单芯电缆。",
        "D.0.6 与 D.0.5 互斥；不推断梯架类别或标准层间距，不覆盖 D.0.7 日照、强制风冷、排管和外部热源。",
        "厂家基准由工程师核对；校正结果不是 IEC 完整热路计算，也不代表厂家保证值。"
      ],
      "description": "读取封签标准依据库的校正系数，将有出处的单根基准载流量换算到保存的实际工况。",
      "parameter_schema": {
        "additionalProperties": false,
